+---
+id: task-003-fix-single-use-coupon-not-returned-on-cancel-check-free-shipping-threshold-report
+type: task
+title: "Fix single-use coupon not returned on cancel; check free-shipping threshold report"
+status: pending
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+## Report 1 — welcome code refused after cancelling
+Cause: `Orders.cancel` gave the coupon back with the customer's name, while the coupon is recorded
+under the order id, so it was never released. Fixed to pass the order id (`src/orders.ts`). Test
+added (red first): a single-use coupon can be used again after its order is cancelled.
+
+## Report 2 — €4.90 shipping on €50.00 of goods
+Not reproducible on the current code: the threshold (`goods >= 5000`) was already fixed under
+task-001. Added a characterization test with a coupon bringing the goods to exactly €50.00 after
+discounts; it passes. Likely the customer ordered before that fix.
